  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（スカウトで見つけてきてくれって言われたけど……\r\n今日はいい子には出会えなかったな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（もう遅いし、そろそろ引き上げて──）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010010,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "005",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": -200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 700
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ん？　かなりパンキッシュな格好をしてるなあの子\r\n……独特の雰囲気があるし、綺麗だし……）",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（──声、かけるしかない！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょっといいですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010020,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……何か用ですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は、芸能事務所でプロデューサーをしているもので……\r\nあ、こちら名刺です。よければ受け取ってください",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実は、君をスカウトしたくて声をかけました\r\nうちの事務所で、アイドルになってみませんか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010030,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "２８３プロダクション……\r\nなんか、唐突すぎませんー？　本気で誘ってるんですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ひと目見て、\r\n素質があると思ったんです──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺と一緒にトップアイドルを目指してみませんか？\r\n新しい世界が見られると思うんです！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010040,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……えー、でもアイドルってー、\r\n学校終わりとかに毎日練習するんですよねー？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010050,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "それはちょっとめんどくさそーじゃないですかぁ？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっと……、君、学生なのか？\r\n大学生？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010060,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "いえー、違いますー",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え！？　じゃあ……\r\n高校生？",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010070,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "そうですケドー？ \r\n見えませんかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "見えない……って、それはどうでもいい。\r\nこんな時間にひとりで、危ないじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010080,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "別にいつもこうですケド……\r\nてか、スカウトのお兄さんの方がめちゃめちゃ怪しいですし",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010090,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "まぁいいや、話は終わりでいいですかぁ？\r\n私、もう行きますねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ、ちょっと待って！",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "x": 200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010100,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……まだ、何か用があるんですかぁ？\r\nアイドル、やりませんよー？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "005",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうじゃない\r\nこんな時間に君ひとり放っておけないだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010110,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "…………\r\n……お兄さん、変わってますねー",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "普通は心配するよ\r\n危険な目にあってからじゃ遅いんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010120,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……初めて会った相手に、こんなしつこく叱る人、\r\nフツーとは言いませんよー？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010130,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "まぁ、そんなに言うなら、お兄さんに免じて\r\n今日は帰ってあげますねー。それではぁ、さよーならぁ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……駅の方向へ向かって行ったな\r\nちゃんと帰宅してくれるといいんだが……）",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "x": 200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "off",
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（さて、今日もスカウトに行ってくるかな\r\n……あの時の様な子に、出会えるといいんだけど……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "001"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0113",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010140,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "こんにちはぁ\r\nこの間のお兄さんいますかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "005",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、君は……あの時の！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010150,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "あ、いたいたぁ。お兄さんの顔、しっかり覚えてますよー\r\nあんなしつこく叱られたの、初めてでしたしー",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010160,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "お兄さんといると面白そうなのでー、\r\nアイドルになってあげてもいいかなぁって思いましたぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当かっ？　てっきり興味がないのかと──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（でも、この子以上に魅力的な子にまだ出会えていないし\r\n……心配なこともあるけど──良しっ！）",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……これからは夜遅い時間にふらふらしないでくれよ\r\nこの約束は絶対守ってもらうぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010170,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "どうですかねー。でも、もしかしたらぁ\r\nそれはお兄さん次第かもしれませんよー？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、俺がプロデューサーとして\r\nしっかりしないとな。これからよろしく！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010180,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "田中摩美々っていいますー。私、悪い子ですし、\r\nたくさん迷惑かけてあげますからね。プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500002/1005001010180"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]